      ],
      "source": "https://www.citydirectory.us/city-amenia-north-dakota.html",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1881 the company built a depot and a grain elevator to move wheat to market.",
